From: jason920612 <jasonya2206@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:08:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Waypoint flush snapshot and exact skip of unchanged sources

Per-player inputs of the pair check are copied into flat arrays per flush;
a source whose block did not change, with only block connections, in a
flush where no pair can be ignored, cannot change any connection and is
skipped (verify with -Dquire.waypoints.verify).

